      "cml:operator": "Implication",
      "cml:premiseText": "(c) the person engages in the conduct in whole or in part because of the person’s belief that the group is distinguished by race, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, intersex status, disability, nationality or national or ethnic origin;"
    },
